ass KDP review?<i></i></button><div class=\"a\"><div><p>Files are prepared to KDP\u2019s formatting guidelines and checked in the previewer before delivery. If KDP flags a formatting issue, we fix it.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"q\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">What do I need to send?<i></i></button><div class=\"a\"><div><p>Your final edited manuscript in Word or Google Docs, your trim size if you have one, and any images, front matter and back matter you want included.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"q\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">Do you edit or proofread?<i></i></button><div class=\"a\"><div><p>Formatting is about layout, not editing. Send your final, edited text so the formatted book matches what you approved.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"q\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">How much does book formatting cost?<i></i></button><div class=\"a\"><div><p>It depends on length, images and formats, so book formatting is quoted per book. Send your manuscript details for a fixed quote.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"}}]}]}, {"id": "94ec250", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "contact-cta", "flex_direction": "row", "css_classes": "fwb"}, "elements": [{"id": "7247814", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "html_tag": "div", "css_classes": "cta rv fwb", "flex_direction": "row"}, 